Hi ggvis team,

I started to explore what ggvis can do in a non-trivial app using hfligths data as example. I summarized the data by flight number and could plot distance by delay. So far so good, but when I put the month as additional variable into the mix  it only works as local ggvis command.

DelayByFlightNum %>%
    ggvis(~dist, ~delay) %>%
    layer_points(fill =~ Month)

Included in a simple shiny app I get an empty plot:

shiny::runGitHub("ggvis-hflights", "thomassiegmund")

Best

Thomas

