Ah, I think you're running into this bug with grouped data in dynamic plots:
https://github.com/rstudio/ggvis/issues/71

You can work around it for now by ungrouping your data:
DelayByFlightNum <- DelayByFlightNum %>% ungroup()

Hopefully we'll have a fix in the next few days.

-Winston

